.TH SDL_SetGPURenderStateSamplerBindings 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_SetGPURenderStateSamplerBindings \- Set sampler bindings variables in a custom GPU render state.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_render.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_SetGPURenderStateSamplerBindings(SDL_GPURenderState *state, int num_sampler_bindings, const SDL_GPUTextureSamplerBinding *sampler_bindings);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The data is copied and will be binded using
.BR SDL_BindGPUFragmentSamplers ()
during draw call execution\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I state
the state to modify\[char46]
.TP
.I num_sampler_bindings
The number of additional fragment samplers to bind\[char46]
.TP
.I sampler_bindings
Additional fragment samplers to bind\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true on success or false on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
This function should be called on the thread that created the renderer\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]6\[char46]0\[char46]

